    "notes": "The three verbs reach the layer through the generic engine alone: nothing in `swcraft_tools/editing/` names `mapping_sets`, and the registry the protocol projects is derived from the contract, which is what `test_generic_core_gate.py` holds. A pair is addressed by `{member: \"VehicleSpeed_Kph\"}` because the collection declares `application` as its `identityField` — the `field` member-identity form, the one `runnables` uses — so re-pointing is an `update` of `implementation` and never of the member as a whole. Removing the empty set is a plain element `remove` and asks the host nothing: no safety rule reads this layer, and no component names the set, so there are no referrers to clear (`remove-memory-resource-with-referrers-cleared` is the shape that has both). The delta is in the projection's own order — removes, creates, then updates — and not in the order the operations were sent."
  }
